OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA blustery day with showers and
OL,6,Fstrong, gusty winds, possibly a rumble
OL,7,Fof thunder in the showers too. Perhaps
OL,8,Fsome shelter up towards Caithness with
OL,9,Fa little more sunshine here.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining windy with showers
OL,12,Fcontinuing into the overnight period,
OL,13,Fwinds strengthening to gales for a
OL,14,Ftime for the North coast and backing
OL,15,Fnorthwesterly so feeling quite cool
OL,16,Flater.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FWinds gradually easing during
OL,19,Fthe day and showers finally becoming
OL,20,Fless frequent with some bright and dry
OL,21,Fweather for the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
