OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,6,Fto start the day on Monday but this
OL,7,Fwill become patchy, perhaps more
OL,8,Fsettled towards the middle of the week
OL,9,Fand feeling warmer but still some
OL,10,Fshowers at times.
